OL,3,GNEWSATonsil-op tot notches up 50 years
OL,4,Ain nursing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse is celebrating the 50th
OL,7,Fanniversary of her joining the NHS.
OL,9,FJanet Alderton, associate director of
OL,10,Fpatient safety at University Hospital
OL,11,FTees, started her career as a cadet
OL,12,Fnurse at Hartlepool General Hospital in
OL,13,F1976.
OL,15,FShe spent 20 years in midwifery before
OL,16,Fentering patient safety and risk
OL,17,Fmanagement, which she called her
OL,18,F"passion", and had wanted to be a nurse
OL,19,Fsince she had her tonsils removed at St
OL,20,FHilda's Hospital in Hartlepool when she
OL,21,Fwas aged just three.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
