OL,3,GNEWSATonsil-op tot notches up 50 years
OL,4,Ain nursing
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's my earliest memory, sitting in a
OL,7,Fcot there and telling my mum I would be
OL,8,Fworking at that hospital when I was
OL,9,Folder," she said.
